+The total canvas width must be: barcode_x + barcode_img.width + PADDING.
+
+After calculating the final dimensions, create the real label_img and a new draw object for it:
+label_img = Image.new('RGB', (label_width, label_height), 'white')
+draw = ImageDraw.Draw(label_img)
+
+Draw the text and paste the barcode using the safe coordinates calculated above.

